{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"centralized-copy","entries":{"war-card-game.copy.faq.0.q":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.faq.0.q","source_hash":"8788e11e58a20d4339822c60f9156e759298d13734ef9e31f7d290b570360536","translation":"ምን ያህል ተጫዋቾች ሊጫወቱ ይችላሉ?"},"war-card-game.copy.fields.faceDown":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.fields.faceDown","source_hash":"1702acf23995ec99f384a247d35159709472560b4ca0e9c384e82328eaa8c425","translation":"ፊት ለፊት ወደ ታች"},"war-card-game.copy.fields.summary":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.fields.summary","source_hash":"1d2ad24094c0a116a056a7c33eca4bc529af719cccd080059fe2e87004f523b7","translation":"አንድ 52-ካርዶች ዱካ, ምንም ጆከሮች. በ 2–4 ተጫዋቾች መካከል እኩል ይከፋፍሉ; ለሦስት ተጫዋቾች አንድ ካርድ በኩል ያድርጉ. ከፍተኛው ካርድ እያንዳንዱን ፍለጋ ያሸንፋል; ቀለሞች ምንም ችግር የላቸውም. አሴት ከፍ ያለ, 2 ዝቅተኛ. በአንድነት ላይ, በጦርነት ውስጥ ተጫዋች ሁሉ አንድ ካርድ ወደ ታች እና አንድ ወደ ላይ ይጥላል. ከፍተኛው ፊት-ወደ-ላይ ካርድ ሁሉንም ይወስዳል. ጦርነትን ካላጠናቀቅክ, ታጥፋለህ. ጨዋታው ረጅም ሊሆን ይችላል እና አብዛኛውን ጊዜ ዕድል ነው."},"war-card-game.copy.privacy":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.privacy","source_hash":"202d04903beac129102d55c4ad6b965fe20fd003c614f24f1c7722243e90e636","translation":"ለመጫወት ነጻ ነው። ካርዶች፣ የጨዋታ ሁኔታ እና የምርጫ ማስቀመጥ በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ይቀራሉ። ምንም ነገር አይጫንም።"},"war-card-game.copy.useTool":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.useTool","source_hash":"2970a57afa6206a19f6ddb69ed0bb744db92efa6cd3424825347e03c97ec92bd","translation":"ጦርነት ይጫወቱ"}},"locale":"am","missing":["war-card-game.copy.name","war-card-game.copy.title","war-card-game.copy.description","war-card-game.copy.intro","war-card-game.copy.exampleHeading","war-card-game.copy.example","war-card-game.copy.howItWorks","war-card-game.copy.details","war-card-game.copy.faqHeading","war-card-game.copy.faq.0.a","war-card-game.copy.faq.1.q","war-card-game.copy.faq.1.a","war-card-game.copy.faq.2.q","war-card-game.copy.faq.2.a","war-card-game.copy.faq.3.q","war-card-game.copy.faq.3.a","war-card-game.copy.faq.4.q","war-card-game.copy.faq.4.a","war-card-game.copy.limitsHeading","war-card-game.copy.limits